         [ 2.5 , 13.75],
         [ 5.  , 22.5 ],
         [ 7.5 , 31.25],
         [10.  , 40.  ]], dtype=float32)>

  `Axis` is where the values will be generated (the dimension in the
  returned tensor which corresponds to the axis will be equal to `num`)

  >>> tf.linspace([0., 5.], [10., 40.], 5, axis=-1)
